I was a tourist, like the OP. According to the spoilers, all tourists 
start neutral and have The Lady as their starting god 
(http://www.steelypips.org/nethack/343/gods-343.html).

According to the prayer spoiler 
http://www.steelypips.org/nethack/pray.html, the only dungeon branch 
that you cannot pray in is Gehennom. Remember the planes are above the 
main dungeon! Also, as I noted in my previous post, I deliberately 
avoided forcing the prayer to work in wizmode; in theory, normal game 
mechanics should have applied in determining its success, although this 
depends on how wizmode is coded (I haven't looked).

I think the rationale is that Gehennom is Moloch's realm, while 
everything above it belongs to the regular characters' gods. By this 
(postulated) rationale, prayer should work on all the planes.


